        "exact_excerpt": "  Sandoval, \nBishop  of  Pampluna,  published  in  the  year  1614 \nhis  monumental  history  of  the  Emperor  Charles  V., \nand  through  his  splendid  volumes  the  deeds  of  the \nMoslem  corsairs  run  like  the  scarlet  thread  which \nis  twisted  through  a  Government  rope.",
